  <spoon:CtClass name="SteamBoilerProgram">
    <comment xsi:type="spoon:CtJavaDoc" commentContent="The steam-boiler control program (SB-V1): runs the five-second cycle of reception,&#xA;analysis and transmission (SB-V3). The plant monitor receives and analyses the&#xA;incoming messages, the mode controller decides the operating mode, the level&#xA;regulator issues the orders of that mode, and the monitor adds the failure&#xA;announcements and repair acknowledgements. Once emergency stop is entered the program&#xA;has stopped (SB-Beh22)."/>
    <modifier>PUBLIC</modifier>
    <modifier>FINAL</modifier>
